doc/tables/ - complete table units
==================================

Each NAME/table.tex owns its environment, caption, label and table layout.
Sections include that unit; previews render it directly with shared styling.

    commands/       UART command payload/reply shapes
    wire-sizes/     byte-cost formulae
    kernel-counts/  per-kernel transaction formulae
    verification/   evidence and limits
    measured/       measured v2/v3 counters; body generated from data/wire-cost.csv

    make -C doc -f doc.mk table-wire-sizes
    make -C doc -f doc.mk tables

Do not hand-edit build/wire-table.tex; regenerate the experiment explicitly
with make -C doc -f doc.mk measure when measured input/source data changes.
